[{"id": "2114779971637911736", "text": "\ud835\udfd6 Games. \ud835\udfd5 CLEAN SHEETS. Young Player of the Tournament. \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8\ud83d\udcab\n\n12th in the Ballon d'Or...\ud83d\ude42", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVk1LOKXkAEpVr6.jpg"}, {"id": "2114784041035538768", "text": "\ud83c\udfa5 | Luis de la Fuente, first one to arrive at the Ballon D'Or red carpet. \ud83c\udf15", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114782163019169792/vid/avc1/1920x1080/IYilrrbDcylAzEWG.mp4?tag=29"}, {"id": "2114785933945975197", "text": "The 2026 Ballon D'Or \ud835\udc13\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc29 \ud835\udfcf\ud835\udfce.", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVk6mbFXUAAfaUV.jpg"}, {"id": "2114787429173297249", "text": "Rodri is ready \u2714", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVk79dQW4AAo0rd.jpg"}, {"id": "2114796982875136037", "text": "001\u2666\ufe0f", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114783955832414209/vid/avc1/1080x1920/L6ixr83myubxejh-.mp4?tag=16"}, {"id": "2114797985800278420", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Andriy Shevchenko (2004 BD'Or winner) at the red carpet: \u201cHaving a great season and scoring lots of goals isn\u2019t enough if you don\u2019t win any trophies.\u201d \ud83c\udf15", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlFj64WIAEn1_M.jpg"}, {"id": "2114798900326367521", "text": "Lamine Yamal and Ines Garcia have ARRIVED at the 2026 #BallonDOr ceremony \ud83c\udf38", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlGZJsWcAAc0bB.jpg"}, {"id": "2114799454444220422", "text": "Bar\u00e7a couples walking on the Red Carpet. \ud83d\udd25", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114798925295087616/vid/avc1/1080x1920/rW3jSn6JkRrtLAnY.mp4?tag=29"}, {"id": "2114800227680973257", "text": "The main man arriving.", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114798003143774208/vid/avc1/480x854/2kCMXIeZDSLKXJWK.mp4?tag=29"}, {"id": "2114804367005995359", "text": "F\u00daTBOL CLUB BARCELONA. \ud83d\udc99\u2764\ufe0f", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlLXGJWwAAVcTn.jpg"}, {"id": "2114806379806421081", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc01\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0a\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc06: The Ballon d\u2019Or ceremony has been DELAYED by 30 minutes due to traffic in London according to Movistar. #fcblive \ud83c\udf15", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlNMTXXUAAbHxN.jpg"}, {"id": "2114806646467699162", "text": "\ud83d\udcf2 | Lamine's dad on IG:", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlNcAPXgAAmU_t.jpg"}, {"id": "2114815348411396529", "text": "\ud83d\udea8 Now delayed by a further 15 minutes. #fcblive", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114815541508477102", "text": "KEYNE IS HERE \ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\udd25", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114814614605041664/vid/avc1/720x1280/NxBcSBQ6Z4zmG9uc.mp4?tag=29"}, {"id": "2114817682524475503", "text": "\ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc18 \ud835\udc22\ud835\udc27 \ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc1d\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc27 \ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udff4\udb40\udc67\udb40\udc62\udb40\udc65\udb40\udc6e\udb40\udc67\udb40\udc7f", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114816591447613440/vid/avc1/1920x1080/7aMamJ9jT5Y3PZu7.mp4?tag=16"}, {"id": "2114818736184058040", "text": "\ud83c\udfa5 | The Bar\u00e7a delegation on the red carpet at #BallonDOr ceremony. \ud83c\udf15", "media_type": "video", "media_url": "https://video.twimg.com/ext_tw_video/2114817890385850368/pu/vid/avc1/1280x720/pSAkeIZbabcw3N7u.mp4?tag=12"}, {"id": "2114820007532110000", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Joan Garc\u00eda: \u201cUnai, David, and I are different, but all three of us deserve to be here. I\u2019m proud of how everything has gone.\u201d #fcblive \ud83d\udd35\ud83d\udd34", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlZlwRWwAAu1BP.jpg"}, {"id": "2114820735763894284", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Rodrigo: \u201cWhen a rival is better than you, you have to accept it. The team wasn\u2019t sharp enough. We\u2019re in October, which is the good part. We have to approach what\u2019s left with humility.\u201d #fcblive \ud83d\udd35\ud83d\udd34", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlaQINXsAA9eL1.jpg"}, {"id": "2114822786745024789", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Joan Laporta: \u201cWe have to face it with sportsmanship. I know Lamine is especially excited about it.\u201d #fcblive \ud83d\udc40", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlcHiCXQAAdDro.jpg"}, {"id": "2114823545230368854", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Joan Laporta: \u201cI believe Hansi Flick is the perfect coach for Barcelona. He understands our original style of football and greatly admires Johan Cruyff\u2019s philosophy.\u201d #fcblive \ud83d\udd35\ud83d\udd34", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlczo0XMAAaSHH.jpg"}, {"id": "2114823719734358192", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc01\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0a\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc06: Lamine Yamal wins the KOPA TROPHY for the 3rd year in a row. #fcblive \ud83c\udf15", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlc90ZWwAAQAMu.jpg"}, {"id": "2114824077168738510", "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83d\udea8\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f| Lamine Yamal: \u201cI think this award should have gone to Pau Cubars\u00ed. I think he deserved it the most.\u201d #fcblive #BallonDOr", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVldSpaWAAALOQ_.jpg"}, {"id": "2114825728055234668", "text": "Lamine Yamal \u2013 3 consecutive Kopa Trophies (record)\nVicky Lopez - 2 consecutive Kopa Trophies (record)\n\n\ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc03\ud835\udc04 \ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d \ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc00 \ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc12\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc00! \u2764", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVleyuQXQAIDoOy.jpg"}, {"id": "2114826817349517641", "text": "\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1e \ud835\udc01\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc12\ud835\udc13  \ud835\udc32\u0336\ud835\udc28\u0336\ud835\udc2e\u0336\ud835\udc27\u0336\u0336\ud835\udc20\u0336 \ud835\udc29\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc32\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc2b \ud835\udc22\ud835\udc27 \ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1e \ud835\udc30\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc1d \u2b50", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlfyCWXgAAp-Qq.jpg"}, {"id": "2114827223786041539", "text": "\u2757\ufe0f| \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc19\ud835\udc18 \ud835\udc05\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13: Barcelona players have won 5 of the 6 Kopa Trophies awarded since the award was introduced. \ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc1a \ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc1a! \ud83d\ude35", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlgJxLWMAAwz1p.jpg"}, {"id": "2114827375540060284", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc0e\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0b: The TOP 10 rankings for the 2026 Kopa Trophy!\n\n\ud83e\udd47 Lamine Yamal\n\ud83e\udd48 Pau Cubars\u00ed\n\ud83e\udd49 Warren Za\u00efre-Emery\n4\ufe0f\u20e3 Lennart Karl\n5\ufe0f\u20e3 Yan Diomand\u00e9\n6\ufe0f\u20e3 Ayyoub Bouaddi\n7\ufe0f\u20e3 Kerim Alajbegovi\u0107\n8\ufe0f\u20e3 Eli Junior Kroupi\n9\ufe0f\u20e3 Ibrahim Maza\n\ud83d\udd1f Johan Manzambi\n\n#fcblive #BallonDOr \ud83c\udf15", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114827703622705633", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc0e\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc05\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0b: Bar\u00e7a Femeni coach Pere Romeu WINS the Best Women's Football Coach award at the 2026 Ballon D'Or. #fcblive \ud83d\udc4f", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVlglteXYAAD1wM.jpg"}, {"id": "2114830195832062152", "text": "\ud83d\udea8| \ud835\udc01\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0a\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc06: Luis de la Fuente has been named as Men's Coach of the Year at the 2026 Ballon D'Or.\n\nWell deserved! \ud83d\udc4f\ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddf8", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVli2v0WMAAhuY6.jpg"}, {"id": "2114833099062128910", "text": "Barcelona and Spain sweeping up everything so far at the #BallonDOr.\n\nCata Coll wins the Women's Best Goalkeeper award and Unai Simon wins the Men's Best Goalkeeper award. \ud83c\udf15\ud83e\udde4", "media_type": null, "media_url": null}, {"id": "2114835650688020657", "text": "Triple sweep \u2705", "media_type": "photo", "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVln0QIWsAEZcGz.jpg"}]